WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.210
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:30.480 --> 00:32.000
[25 °C]

3
00:32.020 --> 00:34.500
25 degrees Celsius and clear weather!

4
00:38.810 --> 00:40.520
The weather is nice today!

5
00:42.000 --> 00:44.010
Good morning, my little trees.

6
00:44.030 --> 00:45.220
Here, have some water.

7
00:49.600 --> 00:51.910
You're still looking good as always.

8
00:52.210 --> 00:53.800
Today is definitely a good day.

9
00:56.620 --> 00:59.120
Today's lucky color is brown...

10
01:00.400 --> 01:01.400
brown...

11
01:01.420 --> 01:02.530
this one...

12
01:02.720 --> 01:04.070
this one is also brown...

13
01:08.300 --> 01:10.000
They're all brown.

14
01:13.710 --> 01:14.710
Okay!

15
01:46.810 --> 01:48.210
The west wall is

16
01:48.230 --> 01:49.960
10 centimeters off the blueprint.

17
01:57.560 --> 01:59.200
They said this is as far as it can go.

18
01:59.520 --> 02:00.730
It's already up against the top wall.

19
02:02.740 --> 02:05.010
I've already accounted for that in the plans.

20
02:05.200 --> 02:06.200
If we don't fix it,

21
02:06.220 --> 02:08.300
the circulation, perspective, skylight,

22
02:08.330 --> 02:09.280
everything will be compromised.

23
02:09.300 --> 02:11.420
The aesthetics, functionality, and cost

24
02:11.440 --> 02:13.480
will all suffer more than the time it takes to fix this.

25
02:13.700 --> 02:14.990
What should we do?

26
02:16.890 --> 02:17.710
Alright.

27
02:18.150 --> 02:19.520
I'll tell the workers to break this down.

28
02:21.510 --> 02:22.510
Thank you.

29
02:23.110 --> 02:24.980
Next time, if you want to change the plans,

30
02:25.000 --> 02:27.300
tell me before the construction starts.

31
02:27.620 --> 02:29.100
We're working together,

32
02:29.320 --> 02:31.090
I'm not supposed to guess what you want.

33
02:37.340 --> 02:37.920
Oud,

34
02:38.600 --> 02:39.600
I need to talk to you.

35
03:04.760 --> 03:06.670
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

36
03:20.610 --> 03:21.610
What?

37
03:21.790 --> 03:22.790
What are you looking at?

38
03:23.680 --> 03:25.410
So brave.

39
03:25.430 --> 03:26.830
So bold.

40
03:26.850 --> 03:29.120
Wearing red on review day.

41
03:31.610 --> 03:33.000
What red, ma'am?

42
03:33.020 --> 03:34.520
This is wine red.

43
03:35.600 --> 03:37.900
Red is red, no matter the shade.

44
03:38.130 --> 03:40.290
But you especially shouldn't wear it today.

45
03:41.220 --> 03:44.910
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

46
03:45.050 --> 03:45.810
Why?

47
03:46.170 --> 03:47.680
Because red...

48
03:50.230 --> 03:51.560
is today's unlucky color!

49
03:53.080 --> 03:54.350
- Unlucky?! - Unlucky?!

50
05:23.760 --> 05:29.440
[Built in Love]

51
05:32.720 --> 05:33.530
Mim.

52
05:36.130 --> 05:37.920
Meet me in the meeting room.

53
05:39.210 --> 05:40.700
Yes, Soul.

54
05:48.420 --> 05:49.120
Stop it!

55
05:49.320 --> 05:51.530
Didn't Pat give you guys enough work or what,

56
05:51.720 --> 05:52.850
Thanwa, Mek?

57
05:54.020 --> 05:55.130
We do have work.

58
05:55.300 --> 05:57.220
But we're the handsome team,

59
05:57.410 --> 05:59.020
so we get it done fast.

60
05:59.230 --> 06:00.210
That's right!

61
06:02.010 --> 06:03.810
We're not making sour faces

62
06:03.830 --> 06:05.210
like Oyl, are we?

63
06:07.310 --> 06:08.620
I'm making a face because of you guys,

64
06:08.640 --> 06:09.490
damn jerks.

65
06:10.600 --> 06:11.530
Don't touch me.

66
06:13.720 --> 06:15.050
Stop it.

67
06:15.160 --> 06:17.100
Or you'll find out

68
06:17.130 --> 06:19.310
who's going to be the unlucky one today.

69
06:19.910 --> 06:21.530
Come on, Oyl.

70
06:21.570 --> 06:22.520
We have a meeting,

71
06:22.920 --> 06:24.420
or Soul will chew us out.

72
06:24.730 --> 06:25.730
Yes.

73
06:25.900 --> 06:26.810
Hurry up!

74
06:26.870 --> 06:29.010
Unlucky this, unlucky that.

75
06:29.510 --> 06:31.390
You keep going on about it.

76
06:31.520 --> 06:33.910
I hope it strikes you instead.

77
06:34.330 --> 06:35.620
Sadhu.

78
06:37.430 --> 06:38.080
What?

79
06:38.100 --> 06:38.890
What are you looking at?!

80
06:39.110 --> 06:40.300
I'll poke your eyes out!

81
06:44.530 --> 06:47.020
I'm late, so late, so late!

82
06:48.620 --> 06:49.760
Xinxin!

83
06:49.790 --> 06:51.840
Breakfast is ready. Come eat first.

84
06:52.230 --> 06:53.780
I don't have time, Mom!

85
06:53.800 --> 06:55.580
I'll come home for dinner, okay?

86
06:55.610 --> 06:56.780
- I'm already running late. - Sure.

87
06:56.800 --> 06:58.050
Oh, wait, wait!

88
06:58.070 --> 06:59.640
I packed some fruit for you, too.

89
07:00.510 --> 07:01.790
Thanks, Mom.

90
07:01.810 --> 07:03.200
See you this evening.

91
07:03.410 --> 07:04.740
I'll eat this in the car.

92
07:04.760 --> 07:06.070
Okay, come...

93
07:11.040 --> 07:12.710
Tie your shoes properly,

94
07:12.730 --> 07:14.400
so you won't trip!

95
07:16.020 --> 07:18.000
Are you ready to go now?

96
07:19.930 --> 07:20.890
Oh no!

97
07:21.030 --> 07:21.930
What do you mean?

98
07:26.000 --> 07:28.650
I stepped out with my right foot first.

99
07:29.000 --> 07:31.050
Oh? I'm sure it's fine, dear.

100
07:31.810 --> 07:34.300
It's not, Mom...

101
07:37.010 --> 07:38.010
Then what should...

102
07:39.000 --> 07:40.140
Let's do this instead.

103
07:40.160 --> 07:41.160
To ward off bad luck.

104
07:44.010 --> 07:45.360
Careful, dear!

105
07:46.520 --> 07:48.910
Are you going to hop all the way to the car?

106
07:50.520 --> 07:51.970
- Oh... - Bye-bye, Mom!

107
07:52.620 --> 07:54.010
Bye-bye, dear.

108
07:56.420 --> 07:57.790
I go by my schedule,

109
07:57.810 --> 07:58.890
not lucky dates.

110
07:59.530 --> 08:00.420
Sorry.

111
08:01.290 --> 08:02.180
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

112
08:02.200 --> 08:03.120
We can start now.

113
08:05.620 --> 08:06.700
For the interior walls,

114
08:06.720 --> 08:09.050
we'll use vertical lines like those on the building

115
08:09.160 --> 08:11.800
to create a sense of space and height.

116
08:11.820 --> 08:12.820
As for the lobby,

117
08:12.850 --> 08:14.310
I've planned the indirect lighting system

118
08:14.620 --> 08:16.870
to complement your skylight

119
08:16.890 --> 08:19.210
and enhance the natural light

120
08:19.230 --> 08:20.310
rather than compete with it.

121
08:27.540 --> 08:28.540
Okay,

122
08:29.260 --> 08:30.170
looks good.

123
08:31.190 --> 08:32.190
You can continue.

124
08:41.010 --> 08:43.920
Excuse me, Soul, I need to answer this call.

125
08:45.720 --> 08:47.900
- Is this the time for that? - Hello, yes...

126
08:51.110 --> 08:52.090
What did our client choose?

127
08:52.110 --> 08:54.090
Oh? This one.

128
08:54.110 --> 08:55.040
Soul!

129
08:55.060 --> 08:55.930
Soul!

130
08:55.960 --> 08:56.730
We're in trouble!

131
08:56.830 --> 08:58.020
Madam Waen just called.

132
08:58.040 --> 09:00.710
She said you have to meet her at her house as soon as possible,

133
09:00.740 --> 09:02.670
- Hey... - or she'll terminate our company's contract.

134
09:02.690 --> 09:03.490
Hey!

135
09:03.530 --> 09:05.720
Why? What happened?!

136
09:05.740 --> 09:07.930
I was just talking to her last month!

137
09:08.200 --> 09:10.040
There weren't any problems,

138
09:10.060 --> 09:12.070
and construction's already underway.

139
09:12.090 --> 09:14.370
How could there be a problem now?!

140
09:15.530 --> 09:16.530
Soul!

141
09:19.100 --> 09:20.860
Wait for me, Soul!

142
09:24.320 --> 09:26.910
House number 859/5...

143
09:27.600 --> 09:28.460
What do you think?

144
09:28.480 --> 09:29.480
Is it good?

145
09:30.510 --> 09:33.440
Your house number...

146
09:35.370 --> 09:36.450
is auspicious.

147
09:37.620 --> 09:39.090
Five means happiness,

148
09:39.110 --> 09:40.730
eight means wealth,

149
09:40.820 --> 09:43.370
and nine means prosperity.

150
09:43.390 --> 09:44.460
According to belief,

151
09:44.480 --> 09:47.530
living here will bring you ever-growing wealth.

152
09:49.980 --> 09:50.850
But...

153
09:50.870 --> 09:52.180
But what?

154
09:52.290 --> 09:53.960
According to the texts,

155
09:53.980 --> 09:55.730
the right side represents fire,

156
09:55.760 --> 09:57.380
and the left represents water,

157
09:57.450 --> 09:59.070
so they must be balanced.

158
09:59.090 --> 10:00.970
The design is correct,

159
10:00.990 --> 10:03.010
with water flowing in front of the house.

160
10:03.030 --> 10:04.280
But the fountain

161
10:04.300 --> 10:05.860
should be on the left

162
10:05.880 --> 10:06.980
to bring peace to the house.

163
10:07.160 --> 10:09.030
If it's slightly to the right,

164
10:09.060 --> 10:10.910
there'll be an imbalance between water and fire,

165
10:10.930 --> 10:12.130
like Yin and Yang.

166
10:12.290 --> 10:14.330
This area should be adjusted.

167
10:14.350 --> 10:15.500
Not a chance!

168
10:24.310 --> 10:25.610
Here comes bad luck...

169
10:25.630 --> 10:26.700
What are you saying?!

170
10:27.630 --> 10:28.630
I'm not.

171
10:28.980 --> 10:29.580
Uh...

172
10:29.710 --> 10:31.500
This is Soul,

173
10:31.520 --> 10:33.520
the architect overseeing this house,

174
10:33.550 --> 10:35.730
and this is Xinxin, a feng shui master.

175
10:36.710 --> 10:38.920
Hello, Miss...

176
10:39.370 --> 10:40.370
Architect.

177
10:42.800 --> 10:44.020
Hello,

178
10:44.050 --> 10:45.400
Miss Feng...

179
10:45.420 --> 10:46.420
Shui!

180
10:47.310 --> 10:48.960
My bonus is so gone...

181
10:52.830 --> 10:54.770
They're not even calling each other by name.

182
10:54.790 --> 10:56.090
You sure they will be alright?

183
10:56.110 --> 10:56.900
I wonder.

184
11:00.050 --> 11:02.600
The reason I asked you to come so urgently

185
11:02.630 --> 11:04.020
is that I want to

186
11:04.040 --> 11:06.620
make some changes to this house to align with feng shui principles.

187
11:06.640 --> 11:08.730
But your house is almost finished, madam.

188
11:08.750 --> 11:10.530
Oh, no worries!

189
11:10.710 --> 11:13.690
If this house doesn't align with feng shui principles,

190
11:13.710 --> 11:15.900
I wouldn't feel comfortable living here.

191
11:15.920 --> 11:18.060
It has nothing to do with feng shui.

192
11:18.120 --> 11:19.500
Of course it does.

193
11:19.910 --> 11:21.400
Because a house is the first gateway

194
11:21.420 --> 11:24.010
that opens the way to the residents' fortune.

195
11:26.110 --> 11:27.710
I'm not talking to you,

196
11:27.730 --> 11:29.020
Miss Feng Shui.

197
11:33.020 --> 11:33.920
Soul...

198
11:33.940 --> 11:35.380
calm down.

199
11:35.410 --> 11:36.300
Keep repeating this.

200
11:36.330 --> 11:39.730
Bonus, bonus, bonus...

201
11:44.310 --> 11:45.220
Madam,

202
11:45.310 --> 11:47.040
what would you like to change?

203
11:47.210 --> 11:49.240
If it's not too much work,

204
11:49.260 --> 11:51.650
we won't charge you extra.

205
11:52.170 --> 11:53.840
Well...

206
11:55.400 --> 11:56.220
Tear it down.

207
11:57.810 --> 12:01.180
Five, six, seven, eight, nine.

208
12:01.200 --> 12:04.430
The number of lights in a house shouldn't be odd.

209
12:04.450 --> 12:05.570
From what I can see,

210
12:05.590 --> 12:07.890
they’re in odd numbers from the gate all the way inside.

211
12:07.910 --> 12:09.370
That's against the principles,

212
12:09.390 --> 12:12.300
because it'll leave the residents single for life.

213
12:12.320 --> 12:15.500
So the lights in the house should be in even numbers,

214
12:15.530 --> 12:17.320
Miss Architect.

215
12:20.910 --> 12:22.230
All the doors

216
12:22.250 --> 12:23.850
shouldn't be aligned.

217
12:24.110 --> 12:25.290
Tear it down.

218
12:25.310 --> 12:26.210
Huh?!

219
12:26.230 --> 12:27.430
The door

220
12:28.010 --> 12:29.310
and balcony

221
12:29.510 --> 12:31.220
shouldn't be aligned.

222
12:32.020 --> 12:33.020
Tear it down.

223
12:38.700 --> 12:39.700
Also...

224
12:53.740 --> 12:55.510
From what I've explained,

225
12:55.530 --> 12:58.460
do you still have a question, Miss Architect?

226
12:58.500 --> 12:59.500
I do.

227
13:00.210 --> 13:01.210
What is it?

228
13:01.230 --> 13:02.900
I'll explain it again.

229
13:04.320 --> 13:06.700
Everything you've mentioned.

230
13:06.720 --> 13:07.780
I don't understand

231
13:07.800 --> 13:10.120
why a feng shui master like you needs to change the house plans

232
13:10.140 --> 13:11.890
when the original one is already good.

233
13:11.910 --> 13:13.580
And some of the things you've suggested

234
13:13.600 --> 13:16.260
can't be changed to comply with feng shui principles

235
13:16.280 --> 13:17.920
because they're not practical,

236
13:17.940 --> 13:19.820
and make my job much harder.

237
13:19.840 --> 13:21.650
The person responsible for this project

238
13:21.680 --> 13:23.810
will end up finishing late, too.

239
13:26.020 --> 13:26.860
But...

240
13:27.250 --> 13:29.310
isn't it an architect's job

241
13:29.710 --> 13:32.040
to build a house to suit its occupants?

242
13:35.380 --> 13:36.460
It is.

243
13:36.490 --> 13:37.910
But if the occupants

244
13:37.930 --> 13:39.490
trust the feng shui master more,

245
13:39.700 --> 13:41.720
then why not let the feng shui master build it?

246
13:42.900 --> 13:43.820
Oh?!

247
13:43.840 --> 13:45.180
Why are you being so harsh?

248
13:45.460 --> 13:46.390
Goodbye.

249
13:46.410 --> 13:47.660
Soul!

250
13:48.810 --> 13:51.060
Why is she being so harsh with me?

251
13:51.220 --> 13:53.220
I'm sorry, madam. I'm so sorry.

252
13:53.960 --> 13:54.840
I'm sorry.

253
13:54.860 --> 13:55.890
Soul!

254
13:55.910 --> 13:56.490
Gosh...

255
13:56.510 --> 13:57.700
- Miss Architect! - Harsh!

256
13:57.720 --> 13:59.110
- Oh... oh... - Oh no, madam!

257
13:59.400 --> 14:01.080
I need my inhaler.

258
14:01.520 --> 14:04.110
I've never heard anything so unpleasant in my life.

259
14:04.130 --> 14:05.190
Take a breath...

260
14:09.860 --> 14:11.030
Soul!

261
14:11.050 --> 14:11.860
Soul!

262
14:11.880 --> 14:12.810
Soul!

263
14:13.210 --> 14:13.750
Soul!

264
14:13.770 --> 14:15.560
Calm down, will you?

265
14:15.710 --> 14:17.620
- About what we've talked...bonus... - Wait!

266
14:21.620 --> 14:22.550
Oyl,

267
14:22.570 --> 14:23.600
wait in the car.

268
14:24.910 --> 14:26.380
But, Soul...

269
14:26.950 --> 14:27.950
please calm down.

270
14:28.290 --> 14:29.630
Wait in the car.

271
14:33.670 --> 14:34.410
Yes...

272
14:39.800 --> 14:43.180
Your design goes against feng shui principles.

273
14:43.200 --> 14:44.930
Living here would be like being in an oven,

274
14:44.960 --> 14:46.390
your love life would be rocky,

275
14:46.410 --> 14:47.930
and your finances would hit a roadblock.

276
14:47.950 --> 14:48.870
Wow...

277
14:48.990 --> 14:51.120
How much did madam pay you

278
14:51.140 --> 14:54.090
to go this far with the feng shui stuff?

279
14:56.300 --> 14:59.200
You can make up stories to fool madam all you want,

280
14:59.420 --> 15:00.900
but not me.

281
15:00.920 --> 15:02.260
I don't believe in it.

282
15:04.220 --> 15:06.400
It's understandable if you don't believe it,

283
15:06.710 --> 15:08.150
so let's meet halfway.

284
15:08.410 --> 15:09.070
Huh?

285
15:09.490 --> 15:10.680
Halfway?

286
15:11.510 --> 15:13.790
Whatever you can change,

287
15:13.810 --> 15:15.320
go ahead and do it.

288
15:16.020 --> 15:18.100
And for the parts you can't change,

289
15:18.130 --> 15:20.530
I'll find a way to boost the energy.

290
15:21.630 --> 15:23.200
Listen,

291
15:23.410 --> 15:25.450
I'm not changing!

292
15:27.030 --> 15:28.150
Wait!

293
15:28.170 --> 15:29.920
What now?

294
15:43.510 --> 15:45.930
Overall, you have good features.

295
15:47.530 --> 15:49.080
Your brows are uneven.

296
15:49.340 --> 15:51.580
According to the texts, you'll have a short temper.

297
15:53.280 --> 15:54.730
But...

298
15:55.660 --> 15:56.610
But what?

299
15:58.320 --> 15:59.690
A broad forehead

300
15:59.960 --> 16:01.010
brings fortune.

301
16:01.820 --> 16:03.510
Your nose is prominent,

302
16:03.610 --> 16:04.670
well-defined,

303
16:04.690 --> 16:05.970
but isn't too sharp.

304
16:06.130 --> 16:08.130
That means you're grounded

305
16:08.150 --> 16:09.510
and reliable.

306
16:12.270 --> 16:12.990
What else?

307
16:13.010 --> 16:14.530
Finish what you were saying.

308
16:14.800 --> 16:15.510
See?

309
16:15.710 --> 16:16.810
You really are short-tempered.

310
16:21.600 --> 16:23.410
Overall, you look good,

311
16:24.320 --> 16:26.330
but you'll be unlucky in love.

312
16:28.520 --> 16:29.820
Like I said.

313
16:29.930 --> 16:30.930
With a mouth like that,

314
16:31.110 --> 16:32.820
who's going to fall for you?

315
16:47.630 --> 16:49.170
I’m withdrawing from this project.

316
16:49.200 --> 16:50.820
No, Soul, you can't!

317
16:50.840 --> 16:52.190
The boss will chew us out.

318
16:53.110 --> 16:54.600
Please calm down, Soul.

319
16:55.190 --> 16:56.410
Just let someone else do it.

320
16:56.430 --> 16:58.050
I'm not the only one in this company.

321
16:58.190 --> 17:00.770
But Madam Waen specifically requested you!

322
17:00.790 --> 17:02.090
That's right.

323
17:02.310 --> 17:03.800
Please think it over again.

324
17:04.340 --> 17:07.310
I mean, this is a big project, too.

325
17:14.730 --> 17:15.730
Yes, boss?

326
17:16.130 --> 17:17.130
Boss?

327
17:18.410 --> 17:19.520
But boss, it's...

328
17:23.620 --> 17:24.620
Understood.

329
17:28.170 --> 17:29.320
How'd it go?

330
17:29.340 --> 17:30.570
What did the boss say?

331
17:30.820 --> 17:31.820
Right.

332
17:32.290 --> 17:33.570
Go get her number.

333
17:34.950 --> 17:36.010
Whose number?

334
17:37.420 --> 17:38.730
That feng shui lady's.

335
17:38.840 --> 17:40.990
Huh? How would I have her number?

336
17:41.220 --> 17:42.050
Wait.

337
17:42.200 --> 17:43.970
I just remembered that the pretty feng shui master

338
17:43.990 --> 17:46.020
might've given me her card.

339
17:46.040 --> 17:48.670
Can you stop calling that problematic feng shui master "pretty"?

340
17:48.690 --> 17:49.820
It's really annoying.

341
17:49.840 --> 17:50.910
Huh?

342
17:51.710 --> 17:53.130
But she's really pretty.

343
17:53.810 --> 17:57.010
Oyl calls every single girl pretty, Soul.

344
17:58.700 --> 17:59.530
True,

345
17:59.580 --> 18:01.000
except for one person.

346
18:01.320 --> 18:01.970
Who?

347
18:02.380 --> 18:03.310
You.

348
18:03.510 --> 18:04.250
Hey!

349
18:05.010 --> 18:06.010
Here you go.

350
18:06.290 --> 18:07.670
- Go away! Back off! - I'll be right back, Soul.

351
18:07.690 --> 18:08.450
Go away!

352
18:08.590 --> 18:09.590
- Hey! - Ow!

353
18:24.010 --> 18:25.410
What's the matter, dear?

354
18:25.870 --> 18:27.830
You're eating like you're mad at someone.

355
18:31.430 --> 18:32.770
You noticed?

356
18:32.850 --> 18:34.650
Why wouldn't I?

357
18:34.810 --> 18:36.580
You look all restless and irritable,

358
18:36.600 --> 18:39.110
and you're eating so much. That's your second plate, dear.

359
18:39.370 --> 18:40.110
Why?

360
18:40.130 --> 18:41.770
Did you get a fussy customer?

361
18:42.710 --> 18:44.520
Not a customer,

362
18:44.620 --> 18:46.120
but an

363
18:46.250 --> 18:48.050
architect.

364
18:48.230 --> 18:49.520
Mom, I don't understand

365
18:49.530 --> 18:52.820
why my client trusts a feng shui master more than an architect.

366
18:54.020 --> 18:56.330
It gives them peace of mind, sweetie.

367
18:56.420 --> 18:57.420
But, Mom!

368
18:57.430 --> 18:59.850
It doesn't give me any peace of mind!

369
19:00.050 --> 19:01.730
Customer satisfaction

370
19:01.750 --> 19:04.290
should always come first, right, Mom?

371
19:04.510 --> 19:05.840
That's true, dear. But...

372
19:05.860 --> 19:09.150
you need to learn to work things out together,

373
19:09.170 --> 19:10.530
talk things through with kindness and patience.

374
19:10.620 --> 19:11.700
Wouldn't that be better?

375
19:13.820 --> 19:16.100
Maybe not this one yet, Mom.

376
19:16.120 --> 19:17.830
We're not compatible.

377
19:18.150 --> 19:20.050
We don't click.

378
19:20.640 --> 19:21.500
Come on...

379
19:21.520 --> 19:24.320
Wouldn't it be better to find a way to work together?

380
19:24.340 --> 19:26.930
It's a small industry, after all.

381
19:26.950 --> 19:28.550
After a project or two,

382
19:28.570 --> 19:30.250
you'll end up crossing paths again.

383
19:31.560 --> 19:33.490
- I have to see her again? - Mm.

384
19:33.800 --> 19:37.050
Sadhu, sadhu, sadhu.

385
19:37.310 --> 19:38.730
Just wait and see, Mom!

386
19:38.750 --> 19:39.910
I will

387
19:39.930 --> 19:42.080
bring every god to fight her.

388
19:42.100 --> 19:43.850
Every god!

389
19:44.150 --> 19:45.520
But if I can choose,

390
19:45.540 --> 19:47.700
I hope we don't see each other again.

391
19:48.046 --> 19:50.700
How could you not see each other again?

392
19:50.820 --> 19:52.310
An architect and a feng shui master

393
19:52.486 --> 19:54.130
are a showdown waiting to happen.

394
19:54.400 --> 19:55.510
Mom...

395
19:55.530 --> 19:57.030
I don't want a rival.

396
19:57.100 --> 19:58.850
I just want to do my job.

397
20:03.220 --> 20:04.810
Calm down.

398
20:06.120 --> 20:07.690
Don't overdo it, dear.

399
20:08.620 --> 20:10.520
You're all I have.

400
20:11.780 --> 20:13.880
You're all I have, too, Mom,

401
20:13.900 --> 20:15.450
so don't worry.

402
20:17.470 --> 20:18.470
Come on.

403
20:18.730 --> 20:20.870
Eat up. I made all this for you.

404
20:21.650 --> 20:22.720
- They're all your favorites. - Okay.

405
20:23.630 --> 20:24.630
Thank you.

406
20:32.640 --> 20:35.750
Renita Rungruengumporn.

407
20:39.450 --> 20:40.910
That name sounds familiar.

408
20:51.060 --> 20:52.360
[Feng shui by Xinxin]

409
20:52.380 --> 20:53.706
[Feng Shui by Xinxin: The Art of Fate and Feng Shui]

410
20:53.800 --> 20:55.040
[Feng Shui by Xinxin: The Art of Fate and Feng Shui]

411
20:55.200 --> 20:56.300
Whoa...

412
20:56.320 --> 20:58.700
She has this many followers?!

413
21:00.840 --> 21:02.050
[Billionaire 'Witaya Rungruengumporn',

414
21:02.070 --> 21:03.120
Automotive Business Owner, and His Family Story]

415
21:03.150 --> 21:04.360
[A Closer Look at Billionaire 'Witaya Rungruengumporn'

416
21:04.370 --> 21:06.030
and 'Linlin', His Actress Daughter]

417
21:06.080 --> 21:07.510
Are they related?

418
21:08.210 --> 21:09.590
Or do they just share a surname?

419
21:10.590 --> 21:12.070
Could they be father and daughter?

420
21:13.890 --> 21:15.490
How could they be father and daughter?

421
21:15.510 --> 21:17.680
He's a billionaire,

422
21:17.700 --> 21:19.800
so why is she working as a feng shui master?

423
21:22.210 --> 21:23.210
Right.

424
21:23.590 --> 21:24.590
Why?

425
21:25.510 --> 21:28.080
Why do I need to care about this feng shui lady?

426
21:28.100 --> 21:28.830
Gosh!

427
21:34.430 --> 21:38.710
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

428
22:08.040 --> 22:09.800
Recorded successfully.

429
22:17.880 --> 22:19.030
I'm sorry.

430
22:19.410 --> 22:21.590
It's okay, you can go first.

431
22:22.310 --> 22:23.590
Uhh...

432
22:24.000 --> 22:25.470
You must be a client.

433
22:25.490 --> 22:27.000
You can go first.

434
22:32.900 --> 22:34.300
Recorded successfully.

435
22:34.320 --> 22:35.590
Thank you.

436
22:44.200 --> 22:45.200
Thank you.

437
22:50.890 --> 22:52.200
I'm Mim,

438
22:52.220 --> 22:54.430
an interior designer here.

439
22:54.780 --> 22:55.990
I'm Lada.

440
22:56.010 --> 22:58.310
I’m thinking of renovating the old building at my place,

441
22:58.330 --> 22:59.680
so I'd like a consultation.

442
23:00.690 --> 23:02.490
It’s a pleasure!

443
23:02.510 --> 23:05.590
Do you have any specific designs or preferences in mind?

444
23:05.910 --> 23:07.590
Or would you like me to make some suggestions?

445
23:07.700 --> 23:09.260
Mmm...

446
23:09.380 --> 23:10.380
I do.

447
23:10.570 --> 23:14.560
For my preference, I like...

448
23:19.080 --> 23:20.970
something interesting,

449
23:21.590 --> 23:24.070
especially if it's pretty.

450
23:33.970 --> 23:35.190
Oh.

451
23:35.380 --> 23:37.710
In that case, I think I know

452
23:37.880 --> 23:39.110
what you'd like.

453
23:41.870 --> 23:43.230
I'll leave it to you, then.

454
23:44.230 --> 23:45.430
My pleasure.

455
23:46.060 --> 23:47.930
I'm glad to have met you today.

456
23:50.560 --> 23:52.190
I'm also glad

457
23:52.370 --> 23:54.590
to be your

458
23:54.600 --> 23:56.190
interior designer.

459
24:13.310 --> 24:15.810
Hello, this is Feng Shui by Xinxin.

460
24:16.030 --> 24:17.710
Lada!

461
24:19.000 --> 24:20.750
When did you get back? Why didn't you tell me?

462
24:20.770 --> 24:22.430
And why are you calling from some random number?

463
24:22.450 --> 24:24.010
Did you change your number without telling me?

464
24:24.030 --> 24:25.750
Wait, wait. Calm down.

465
24:25.770 --> 24:27.310
One question at a time.

466
24:28.290 --> 24:29.910
Give me some breathing room.

467
24:30.210 --> 24:32.770
Tell me everything. Don't even think about hiding anything.

468
24:32.990 --> 24:35.210
I've been back for two or three days,

469
24:35.230 --> 24:36.120
and I'm kind of busy.

470
24:36.150 --> 24:38.030
My father handed over the business to me,

471
24:38.050 --> 24:39.950
so I have a few things to sort out.

472
24:40.350 --> 24:42.100
I just talked to a designer,

473
24:42.120 --> 24:43.120
and it was amazing.

474
24:43.290 --> 24:45.270
Gosh, I miss you!

475
24:45.290 --> 24:47.870
So does this mean we're finally back together?

476
24:47.910 --> 24:48.710
Mm!

477
24:51.300 --> 24:53.910
Wait, what about your phone number?

478
24:54.100 --> 24:55.270
Well, a feng shui master...

479
24:55.520 --> 24:57.490
told me to change it, so I did.

480
24:57.510 --> 24:59.310
I changed it just like you told me to.

481
24:59.340 --> 25:02.070
Lucky number: four, five, six, slaying every single event.

482
25:02.490 --> 25:05.000
Master Xinxin charges a fortune.

483
25:05.030 --> 25:06.910
Who wouldn't believe that, right?

484
25:08.690 --> 25:09.690
Well, there is someone.

485
25:09.710 --> 25:10.930
Someone who doesn't believe that.

486
25:10.950 --> 25:12.150
There's this one person.

487
25:12.480 --> 25:13.480
Who?

488
25:13.500 --> 25:14.590
Your customer?

489
25:15.600 --> 25:19.190
Every single customer believes what I told them,

490
25:19.510 --> 25:21.830
but this time, it's an architect.

491
25:22.500 --> 25:23.680
Normally,

492
25:23.700 --> 25:25.400
I never lose.

493
25:25.480 --> 25:27.150
But this architect

494
25:27.320 --> 25:28.550
was a tough one.

495
25:29.780 --> 25:32.630
Feng shui masters and architects never get along anyway, do they?

496
25:33.300 --> 25:34.480
You're right,

497
25:34.500 --> 25:36.890
but I never thought we’d hate each other this much.

498
25:43.980 --> 25:45.210
Hello?

499
25:46.800 --> 25:47.800
Yes, I am.

500
25:49.690 --> 25:50.690
Who?

501
26:07.380 --> 26:08.830
Seriously, Miss Architect,

502
26:08.850 --> 26:10.870
do you have to be an omen of bad luck every day?

503
26:15.000 --> 26:16.000
Take a seat.

504
26:16.270 --> 26:17.710
It won't take long.

505
26:18.310 --> 26:19.310
Then I'll stand.

506
26:19.880 --> 26:21.690
That's inconvenient.

507
26:22.140 --> 26:23.490
Not for me.

508
26:32.100 --> 26:33.590
What do you want to talk about?

509
26:35.200 --> 26:37.090
Did Madam Waen tell you

510
26:37.110 --> 26:38.590
that I'm still in charge of this project?

511
26:39.310 --> 26:40.510
Are you hard up for money?

512
26:41.020 --> 26:43.310
Why wouldn't I want money?

513
26:43.890 --> 26:45.230
Don't you?

514
26:51.850 --> 26:53.550
Here, look.

515
26:53.940 --> 26:56.550
I revised the house design as you suggested,

516
26:56.930 --> 26:58.540
but let me make one thing clear.

517
26:58.560 --> 27:00.980
This will be the final revision.

518
27:01.000 --> 27:02.950
And don't you dare pitch any more weird ideas

519
27:03.086 --> 27:04.413
to Madam Waen.

520
27:07.790 --> 27:08.380
Hey.

521
27:09.090 --> 27:11.310
Isn't the fountain too large, Miss Architect?

522
27:11.680 --> 27:13.000
But you said

523
27:13.020 --> 27:14.280
it was too small.

524
27:14.890 --> 27:16.570
But if it's this large,

525
27:16.600 --> 27:18.030
it'll be a waterfall instead.

526
27:20.710 --> 27:21.510
And...

527
27:21.710 --> 27:23.590
how many lights did you put in?

528
27:23.610 --> 27:24.390
Twenty.

529
27:25.080 --> 27:26.070
Twenty?!

530
27:26.420 --> 27:27.150
Mm.

531
27:27.310 --> 27:28.890
You're the one who said

532
27:28.910 --> 27:30.430
it had to be an even number.

533
27:30.700 --> 27:32.350
So how is twenty not even?

534
27:34.130 --> 27:36.800
With this many lights, the place might as well be an oven.

535
27:36.820 --> 27:38.230
Four would be enough.

536
27:41.290 --> 27:43.320
And these stairs.

537
27:43.340 --> 27:44.750
Why make them spiral?

538
27:45.030 --> 27:47.190
In case Madam Waen gets lazy,

539
27:47.490 --> 27:48.990
she can slide down them.

540
27:51.200 --> 27:53.630
Are you really an architect?

541
27:58.410 --> 27:59.750
This is the actual design.

542
28:01.790 --> 28:03.110
Then what was that one?

543
28:03.600 --> 28:05.110
I made it for fun.

544
28:06.500 --> 28:07.500
Got nothing to do?

545
28:19.200 --> 28:20.200
It looks good.

546
28:20.870 --> 28:21.650
Okay,

547
28:22.320 --> 28:24.150
then I'll send it to Pailin.

548
28:25.000 --> 28:26.910
Whatever, I'm leaving.

549
28:45.390 --> 28:46.510
What's that?

550
28:47.190 --> 28:48.190
An inhaler.

551
28:49.120 --> 28:51.300
I know it's an inhaler,

552
28:51.530 --> 28:53.020
but why are you giving it to me?

553
28:53.950 --> 28:56.250
Green is a lucky color.

554
28:56.270 --> 28:59.850
Maybe you should carry something that isn't bad luck for once.

555
29:00.250 --> 29:02.810
I haven't used it. You can have it.

556
29:04.020 --> 29:05.620
Why would I need it?

557
29:06.970 --> 29:09.830
So you can stop looking so annoyed

558
29:09.850 --> 29:11.820
every time you see my face.

559
29:14.960 --> 29:16.420
So...

560
29:17.220 --> 29:18.820
you still want to see me?

561
29:50.980 --> 29:52.550
[Pailin]

562
29:53.940 --> 29:55.610
Hello, Pailin.

563
29:55.630 --> 29:57.160
Hello, Soul.

564
29:57.190 --> 29:59.090
I'm calling to let you know that

565
29:59.110 --> 30:00.940
Madam was very happy with

566
30:01.036 --> 30:03.180
the revised house design you submitted.

567
30:03.260 --> 30:06.030
You can go ahead with the next steps.

568
30:06.050 --> 30:07.453
Really?

569
30:07.570 --> 30:09.940
Then I'll proceed with it.

570
30:09.990 --> 30:11.420
Thank you so much.

571
30:15.750 --> 30:17.130
Finally!

572
30:17.150 --> 30:19.120
Let's call it a day!

573
30:40.940 --> 30:42.410
Goodbye,

574
30:42.800 --> 30:43.903
Miss Feng Shui. [Block]

575
30:51.850 --> 30:54.110
Madam approved the latest design.

576
30:54.130 --> 30:55.880
Let us never meet again,

577
30:55.900 --> 30:58.000
Miss Feng... Shui!

578
30:58.420 --> 31:01.100
Yes, yes, yes!

579
31:02.120 --> 31:05.220
As if I'd want to see you, Miss Architect.

580
31:10.640 --> 31:11.830
Mom,

581
31:11.850 --> 31:13.580
I'm coming home.

582
31:13.780 --> 31:16.900
Please get the dinner ready!

583
31:25.460 --> 31:26.250
Here you go, dear.

584
31:26.280 --> 31:27.280
Thank you.

585
31:29.470 --> 31:30.860
Whoa...

586
31:30.980 --> 31:33.180
There's so much food today.

587
31:33.330 --> 31:35.786
It's just the two of us, Mom.

588
31:35.860 --> 31:38.610
You said everything went well today,

589
31:38.690 --> 31:40.570
so we have to celebrate.

590
31:43.150 --> 31:44.130
So...

591
31:44.150 --> 31:45.680
what did you do

592
31:45.700 --> 31:47.720
to get the architect to agree with you?

593
31:49.090 --> 31:51.110
Maybe it's because

594
31:51.130 --> 31:54.240
I stepped out of the house with my left foot today.

595
31:56.930 --> 31:57.720
Shall we eat?

596
31:57.740 --> 31:58.450
Right.

597
32:02.320 --> 32:03.140
Here,

598
32:03.810 --> 32:05.110
have some more

599
32:05.130 --> 32:08.320
to fill you up a little.

600
32:10.630 --> 32:11.570
Thanks, Mom.

601
32:15.430 --> 32:16.430
Oh,

602
32:16.930 --> 32:17.930
Xinxin.

603
32:18.310 --> 32:20.500
Your dad called today.

604
32:21.510 --> 32:25.320
He asked how you were doing.

605
32:29.920 --> 32:32.420
The food is so good, Mom.

606
32:33.410 --> 32:35.780
Please don't ruin my appetite.

607
32:53.750 --> 33:02.930
[Madam Waen]

608
33:10.080 --> 33:11.920
Hello...

609
33:15.130 --> 33:16.280
Another revision?!

610
33:16.300 --> 33:18.200
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

611
33:18.370 --> 33:19.520
Where are you going, Soul?

612
33:19.540 --> 33:20.610
To Madam Waen's house.

613
33:20.640 --> 33:21.640
- No! - You can't!

614
33:21.930 --> 33:23.670
Calm down! Don't go yet!

615
33:23.700 --> 33:25.120
Let go of me!

616
33:25.140 --> 33:26.180
You can't go, Soul!

617
33:26.200 --> 33:27.330
If you go there now,

618
33:27.350 --> 33:28.480
her house will go up in flames

619
33:28.500 --> 33:30.610
without us even lighting twenty light bulbs.

620
33:30.630 --> 33:31.520
That's right.

621
33:31.540 --> 33:33.100
Please calm down first.

622
33:33.120 --> 33:34.300
You can't go.

623
33:34.320 --> 33:35.970
Madam Waen is our VIP client,

624
33:35.990 --> 33:37.370
and the boss won't put up with this.

625
33:37.400 --> 33:38.710
Think about it.

626
33:38.910 --> 33:39.820
Calm down.

627
33:39.840 --> 33:40.930
How about this?

628
33:40.950 --> 33:43.250
Why don't you talk to that feng shui master, Xinxin, first?

629
33:43.270 --> 33:44.310
- That's right. - Please...

630
33:44.330 --> 33:46.210
Calm down.

631
33:59.920 --> 34:01.280
Oh...

632
34:01.300 --> 34:02.790
you blocked me?

633
34:03.090 --> 34:04.640
Are we doing this now?

634
34:04.660 --> 34:08.480
[Block]

635
34:08.510 --> 34:10.700
Why did you block her, then?

636
34:10.720 --> 34:12.000
Yeah.

637
34:12.030 --> 34:12.990
What was that about?

638
34:13.010 --> 34:14.720
You finished the job, and that was it?

639
34:15.710 --> 34:17.500
I didn't have anything else to say to her.

640
34:17.830 --> 34:19.300
And do you now?

641
34:19.910 --> 34:20.800
Yeah.

642
34:20.990 --> 34:22.620
Don't make me start...

643
34:24.680 --> 34:25.700
I'm sorry...

644
34:28.010 --> 34:29.610
Give me your phone.

645
34:30.420 --> 34:31.620
I'll talk to her.

646
34:33.410 --> 34:34.410
Gimme.

647
34:43.110 --> 34:44.290
Well...

648
34:46.020 --> 34:47.400
She blocked you too.

649
34:50.320 --> 34:52.100
What should we do now...

650
34:52.120 --> 34:54.310
Hello, Feng Shui Master Xinxin.

651
34:54.330 --> 34:56.500
This is Mim, one of Soul's team members.

652
34:56.520 --> 34:58.960
Soul's phone has been acting up,

653
34:58.980 --> 35:00.960
and it accidentally blocked all her contacts.

654
35:06.830 --> 35:08.210
I bet something's going on.

655
35:08.720 --> 35:10.420
I think...

656
35:10.730 --> 35:12.010
thing is about to get real juicy.

657
35:13.210 --> 35:14.730
Keep your ears open, Mek,

658
35:14.750 --> 35:16.330
so we can tell Pat too.

659
35:16.350 --> 35:18.240
Soul is working on it now,

660
35:18.260 --> 35:20.900
but I'd like to ask you

661
35:20.930 --> 35:23.210
to please unblock Soul's number.

662
35:23.230 --> 35:25.410
We still have some work to discuss,

663
35:25.430 --> 35:27.530
and I understand there may have been a misunderstanding.

664
35:27.550 --> 35:30.010
I sincerely apologize on Soul's behalf again,

665
35:30.030 --> 35:32.710
or you can contact me instead.

666
35:33.910 --> 35:35.330
Done.

667
35:35.350 --> 35:37.010
Looking good and clever,

668
35:37.040 --> 35:38.620
like we've got a master plan.

669
35:38.650 --> 35:39.880
Damn,

670
35:40.150 --> 35:41.620
who would believe that?

671
35:42.310 --> 35:44.100
Ugh, Oyl!

672
35:44.120 --> 35:47.180
If you're not helping, just sit there quietly.

673
35:47.200 --> 35:48.940
I don't need your opinions.

674
35:49.190 --> 35:49.970
Hey,

675
35:49.990 --> 35:50.890
let's think about it.

676
35:50.910 --> 35:52.610
An architect and a feng shui master...

677
35:52.630 --> 35:54.240
how could they ever stay apart?

678
35:54.920 --> 35:55.890
Seriously,

679
35:55.910 --> 35:57.220
you have to tell Soul

680
35:57.240 --> 35:58.480
that...

681
35:58.500 --> 35:59.490
next time,

682
35:59.510 --> 36:01.850
she shouldn't block people willy-nilly.

683
36:01.970 --> 36:02.970
Getting bold lately, huh?

684
36:05.330 --> 36:07.660
I'm sorry. I just want to...

685
36:07.690 --> 36:09.420
talk some sense into you.

686
36:10.500 --> 36:11.730
Uh, no...

687
36:11.750 --> 36:14.480
I just, uh...want to be

688
36:14.510 --> 36:16.110
your thinking partner and supporter,

689
36:16.130 --> 36:17.990
because you're my leader,

690
36:18.010 --> 36:18.920
and I'm your subordinate,

691
36:18.940 --> 36:20.700
so you know what you're doing, of course.

692
36:20.840 --> 36:22.480
Right, Mim?

693
36:22.500 --> 36:23.610
- Hey. - Look at you!

694
36:24.210 --> 36:25.920
- Don't ask me for help. - Oh...

695
36:26.210 --> 36:27.270
Enough.

696
36:27.300 --> 36:28.720
The task I assigned you

697
36:28.740 --> 36:30.160
is due today.

698
36:30.300 --> 36:31.400
- Yes... - Don't slack off.

699
36:31.420 --> 36:33.500
- Understood... - Even if I'm not at the desk,

700
36:33.520 --> 36:35.730
the deadline is still today. Understand?

701
36:35.900 --> 36:37.110
Understood.

702
36:38.700 --> 36:40.100
Getting called out on your work now, huh?

703
37:00.520 --> 37:02.600
Hello, Miss Architect.

704
37:03.420 --> 37:05.930
Do you know Madam Waen wants us to revise the design again?

705
37:06.530 --> 37:07.570
I do.

706
37:07.590 --> 37:09.330
What does that have to do with me?

707
37:09.490 --> 37:10.820
It does!

708
37:10.840 --> 37:12.380
It's because of your suggestions

709
37:12.410 --> 37:14.680
that Madam Waen keeps asking for endless revisions.

710
37:14.820 --> 37:18.350
Seriously, did you put ideas in her head again?

711
37:18.370 --> 37:19.310
Gosh,

712
37:19.330 --> 37:21.730
I'm not that free, you know.

713
37:23.310 --> 37:24.460
Okay,

714
37:24.490 --> 37:27.530
I don't want to waste my time on one project either.

715
37:28.120 --> 37:29.700
If I want you

716
37:29.720 --> 37:31.700
to help revise the blueprint one last time,

717
37:31.720 --> 37:33.320
will you work with me?

718
37:36.610 --> 37:38.240
And what do you have to offer in return?

719
37:38.500 --> 37:39.700
What do you want?

720
37:39.830 --> 37:40.570
Money.

721
37:40.930 --> 37:41.660
How much?

722
37:42.020 --> 37:42.880
Twenty grand.

723
37:43.520 --> 37:44.790
That's too much!

724
37:45.280 --> 37:46.670
How much are you offering?

725
37:46.890 --> 37:47.590
Two thousand.

726
37:48.600 --> 37:50.870
You've got some nerve, haggling this hard.

727
37:51.090 --> 37:53.490
Hey, for two thousand, we won't have to see each other again.

728
37:53.760 --> 37:54.920
How is that unfair?

729
37:54.940 --> 37:56.230
I don't like you.

730
37:56.250 --> 37:57.410
You don't like me either.

731
37:57.650 --> 37:58.580
It’s totally worth it.

732
37:58.620 --> 38:00.110
It's a win-win for both of us, alright?

733
38:02.030 --> 38:03.020
Deal.

734
38:03.040 --> 38:04.530
I'll work with you,

735
38:04.550 --> 38:06.310
so we won't have to see each other again.

736
38:07.210 --> 38:08.210
Okay.

737
38:08.570 --> 38:10.330
We won't have to see each other again.

738
38:21.320 --> 38:23.720
Wait...where are you taking me?

739
38:24.150 --> 38:25.320
My house.

740
38:25.500 --> 38:26.500
Huh?!

741
38:33.040 --> 38:34.840
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

742
38:36.270 --> 38:37.110
So...

743
38:37.240 --> 38:39.040
why did you bring me here?

744
38:39.190 --> 38:40.120
Why?

745
38:40.140 --> 38:41.160
Scared?

746
38:42.110 --> 38:44.010
Why should I be scared?

747
38:44.320 --> 38:45.250
Good.

748
38:45.270 --> 38:46.740
If you aren't scared,

749
38:46.760 --> 38:48.120
then let's head inside.

750
38:51.080 --> 38:53.580
Sadhu, I hope everything will go smoothly today.

751
38:53.680 --> 38:55.430
Hey, wait for me!

752
38:56.020 --> 38:57.610
Wait!

753
38:57.990 --> 38:58.770
Ugh...

754
39:06.900 --> 39:09.500
You wait here for a second, I'll grab something upstairs.

755
39:09.620 --> 39:10.620
Hey,

756
39:10.730 --> 39:12.730
aren't you going to offer your guest some water?

757
39:13.720 --> 39:14.840
You're so demanding.

758
39:16.510 --> 39:17.480
Fine...

759
39:17.500 --> 39:18.170
I'm leaving.

760
39:18.190 --> 39:19.670
Hey, you!

761
39:20.540 --> 39:22.410
Okay, what do you want?

762
39:22.600 --> 39:24.410
Water or juice?

763
39:27.110 --> 39:28.110
I'm fine with either.

764
39:28.150 --> 39:29.620
It's up to you.

765
39:52.530 --> 39:53.620
What do you say?

766
39:57.330 --> 39:58.820
Thank you.

767
40:14.810 --> 40:16.320
This cake is so good!

768
40:16.920 --> 40:18.500
My mom made it.

769
40:23.710 --> 40:25.170
Can I...

770
40:25.610 --> 40:27.520
take some home with me?

771
40:32.120 --> 40:33.600
I'll save some for you.

772
40:44.400 --> 40:46.210
Wait here.

773
40:46.230 --> 40:47.820
I'll go upstairs and grab something.

774
41:20.680 --> 41:23.270
She was so adorable as a kid,

775
41:23.300 --> 41:25.410
so how'd she grow up this fierce?

776
41:26.980 --> 41:28.910
I'm still adorable, though,

777
41:32.620 --> 41:33.860
but only to some people.

778
41:34.730 --> 41:35.730
Oh!

779
41:40.220 --> 41:41.840
You've got a sharp tongue.

780
41:44.670 --> 41:45.870
Um...

781
41:46.230 --> 41:47.730
Is your house

782
41:48.220 --> 41:49.410
right by the water?

783
41:51.010 --> 41:52.280
Yeah.

784
41:52.300 --> 41:53.830
Why, Miss Feng Shui?

785
41:54.200 --> 41:56.810
Is there something wrong with my house's feng shui?

786
41:57.540 --> 41:59.010
Nothing.

787
41:59.320 --> 42:01.520
I just wanted to tell you that

788
42:01.980 --> 42:03.820
people who choose a house by the water

789
42:04.120 --> 42:06.850
are actually sensitive, Miss Architect.

790
42:09.120 --> 42:10.050
Sensitive,

791
42:10.310 --> 42:13.400
but like to hide it behind walls.

792
42:20.920 --> 42:22.210
Am I right?

793
42:37.756 --> 42:40.820
When will you be back, dear?

794
42:40.983 --> 42:42.283
Dad came over and is waiting for you

795
42:43.560 --> 42:44.750
How is that unfair?

796
42:44.770 --> 42:46.060
I don't like you.

797
42:46.080 --> 42:47.260
You don't like me either.

798
42:47.500 --> 42:48.500
It’s totally worth it.

799
42:48.520 --> 42:49.770
It's a win-win for both of us, alright?

800
42:59.900 --> 43:02.260
[When will you be back, dear? Dad came over and is waiting for you]

801
43:08.730 --> 43:09.730
Deal.

802
43:09.760 --> 43:11.240
I'll work with you,

803
43:11.260 --> 43:12.840
so we won't have to see each other again.

804
43:20.240 --> 43:22.130
I'm sorry, Mom.

805
43:22.150 --> 43:23.800
I have urgent work today,

806
43:23.830 --> 43:25.420
so I'll be home late.

807
43:32.740 --> 43:34.450
Maybe staying here...

808
43:34.940 --> 43:36.630
is better than going back home.

809
44:11.520 --> 44:12.630
Oh?!

810
44:13.730 --> 44:14.650
Hello!

811
44:14.750 --> 44:15.603
Hi...

812
44:17.410 --> 44:18.270
Uh...

813
44:18.290 --> 44:19.700
- are you... - Oh, I'm...

814
44:19.740 --> 44:20.510
I'm with...

815
44:20.573 --> 44:21.340
- Soul... - Oh.

816
44:21.410 --> 44:23.190
Are you Soul's girlfriend?

817
44:37.180 --> 44:38.793
Hope we don’t get to meet again,

818
44:38.986 --> 44:40.423
Miss Architect.

819
44:40.606 --> 44:41.980
There’s something between

820
44:42.073 --> 44:44.126
Miss Feng Shui and Miss Architect, isn’t it?

821
44:44.263 --> 44:46.706
Did you do this to every client of yours?

822
44:47.786 --> 44:50.120
If I’m cheering for the boxing,

823
44:50.306 --> 44:53.060
- I’ll root for this pair. - Mom!

824
44:57.343 --> 44:59.260
Did you just trick me here again?

825
45:03.440 --> 45:05.940
And nine means prosperity.

826
45:05.960 --> 45:07.070
According to belief,

827
45:07.090 --> 45:08.600
- living here will bring you... - Hey,

828
45:08.630 --> 45:10.130
we can't have any drama today,

829
45:10.150 --> 45:11.150
okay?

830
45:12.580 --> 45:13.620
The other day

831
45:13.640 --> 45:16.030
when you blew up at Vikrom's feng shui master,

832
45:16.050 --> 45:18.040
our boss chewed me out so bad I’m still traumatized.

833
45:18.110 --> 45:19.270
How could I not lose it?

834
45:19.300 --> 45:21.040
He wanted a zigzag spiral staircase,

835
45:21.070 --> 45:22.450
like a dragon holding a pearl,

836
45:22.470 --> 45:24.030
with glossy steps

837
45:24.050 --> 45:25.570
as slippery as a water slide!

838
45:25.600 --> 45:27.080
I'm going to lose my mind!

839
45:27.540 --> 45:28.840
Come on.

840
45:29.100 --> 45:30.100
Okay,

841
45:30.260 --> 45:31.460
keep repeating this.

842
45:31.480 --> 45:32.420
Bonus.

843
45:32.440 --> 45:33.440
Bonus.

844
45:33.920 --> 45:35.270
Bonus...

845
45:35.680 --> 45:36.560
Bonus...

846
45:36.640 --> 45:37.860
But the fountain

847
45:37.880 --> 45:39.450
should be on the left

848
45:39.470 --> 45:40.640
to bring peace to the house.

849
45:40.660 --> 45:42.490
- If it's slightly to the right, - "Bonus..."

850
45:42.510 --> 45:44.250
- there'll be an imbalance between water and fire, - "Bonus..."

851
45:44.270 --> 45:45.630
- like Yin and Yang. - "Bonus..."

852
45:45.660 --> 45:47.130
This area should be adjusted.

853
45:47.160 --> 45:48.030
Not a chance!

854
45:48.050 --> 45:48.970
Ugh...

855
45:51.750 --> 45:52.970
Here comes bad luck...
